    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>SUMS</strong> is a thrilling roguelike 2D adventure in which you and your friends explore the murky depths of a mysterious dungeon. After your ship is destroyed, you awaken on a strange, cursed island - created by none other than the maniacal Professor Vincent von Vincent. With no way to escape, he forces you and your friends into a dangerous dungeon from which only the bravest adventurers can escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal? Survive, defeat monsters and earn as many points as possible while trying to escape the ominous depths of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963850/extras/f50ca8b50466a021a0598296bbd9d673.avif?t=1730153166\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Class</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from one of three classes to find the right hero for you to immerse yourself in. Your friends might need it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready to survive the dungeon and get the highest score?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong>Team up with your friends and find out as you battle the pitfalls of the dungeon together and try to escape Professor Vincent's diabolical plans. But remember: only the best escape!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>SUMS</strong> is a thrilling roguelike 2D adventure in which you and your friends explore the murky depths of a mysterious dungeon. After your ship is destroyed, you awaken on a strange, cursed island - created by none other than the maniacal Professor Vincent von Vincent. With no way to escape, he forces you and your friends into a dangerous dungeon from which only the bravest adventurers can escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal? Survive, defeat monsters and earn as many points as possible while trying to escape the ominous depths of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963850/extras/f50ca8b50466a021a0598296bbd9d673.avif?t=1730153166\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Class</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from one of three classes to find the right hero for you to immerse yourself in. Your friends might need it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready to survive the dungeon and get the highest score?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong>Team up with your friends and find out as you battle the pitfalls of the dungeon together and try to escape Professor Vincent's diabolical plans. But remember: only the best escape!</p>",
